---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import MarketingChrome from "../../components/MarketingChrome.astro";

const phoneDisplay = "(501) 413-3386";
const tel = "tel:+15014133386";
const sms = "sms:+15014133386";
---

<Base
  title="Henderson Barbershop Websites, Free Demo | NV Labs"
  description="A free demo website for your Henderson barbershop with kids' cuts, family booking, and commuter hours. Call or text (501) 413-3386."
  image="/og.png"
  robots="index, follow"
>
  <MarketingChrome>
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">Henderson barbershops</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Websites for Henderson barbershops that cut for the whole family</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Free demo first. Kids' cuts, family booking, and hours that fit commuter schedules. Call or
        text to get started.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-accent btn-lg" href={tel}>Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href={sms}>Text me</a>
        <a class="btn btn-text" href="/las-vegas-barbershop-website/">Las Vegas barbershop websites</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="family-title">
      <h2 id="family-title">Henderson is a family town</h2>
      <p>
        A lot of your chairs are filled by dads and sons, first haircuts, and back-to-school rushes.
        Your website should show that you're a good spot for kids, not just adults.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'll add a section about kids' cuts, what age you start, and anything that helps nervous
        little ones. Parents read that stuff closely.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="commute-title">
      <h2 id="commute-title">Booking around commuter schedules</h2>
      <p>
        Plenty of people in Henderson drive into Las Vegas for work and back again on the 215 or
        I-11. They want a cut early before work, right after, or on Saturday morning.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you open early or stay late certain days, I'll put that front and center. A line like
        "Open at 7 on weekdays" can win over someone who thought they'd never find time.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="part-title">
      <h2 id="part-title">Your part of Henderson</h2>
      <p>
        Henderson covers a lot of ground. A shop near the Water Street District serves a different
        crowd than one out by Inspirada or Cadence. I'll write your site so it sounds like your
        corner of town, whether that's Green Valley, Anthem, Seven Hills, or somewhere else. I'm
        based in Las Vegas, so I know the area.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="book-title">
      <h2 id="book-title">Family booking made simple</h2>
      <p>
        Booking three kids and a dad back to back is a pain on most apps. I'll add a short note or a
        simple request form for group appointments, so families can text one request and you line up
        the chairs.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="vibe-title">
      <h2 id="vibe-title">Show off your shop's vibe</h2>
      <p>
        Families want to know what they're walking into. I'll add photos of your shop, your chairs,
        and your team, plus a short line about the feel of the place. Laid back, sports on the TV,
        whatever fits you.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="demo-title">
      <h2 id="demo-title">Free demo, all by text</h2>
      <p>
        I build your demo and text you the link. Show it to your barbers and see what they think. If
        you like it, I put it live. If not, no worries. We work by call and text.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
      <h2 id="faq-title">FAQ</h2>
      <div class="faq">
        <div>
          <h3>Can parents book a few kids at once?</h3>
          <p>
            Yes. I can add a group booking request, so a parent sends one message with everyone's
            names and preferred times.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>I already have a booking app. Do I still need a website?</h3>
          <p>
            Your booking app is great for scheduling. Your website tells new families who you are,
            shows your shop, and helps you come up when people in Henderson search for a barber. I'll
            link your booking app right from the site.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Should my site mention specific neighborhoods?</h3>
          <p>
            I'll mention the parts of Henderson you actually serve, in a natural way. It helps
            locals know you're close by.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
      <h2 id="cta-title">Let's build your Henderson shop's demo</h2>
      <p>Text me your shop name and I'll start on it.</p>
      <a class="phone-big" href={tel}>{phoneDisplay}</a>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-accent btn-lg" href={tel}>Call</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href={sms}>Text</a>
      </div>
      <p class="related">
        Have a shop elsewhere in the valley? See my page on
        <a href="/las-vegas-barbershop-website/">barbershop websites in Las Vegas</a>.
      </p>
      <a class="back-home" href="/">Back to NV Labs home</a>
    </section>
  </MarketingChrome>
</Base>
